    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d805">

                <pb facs="0901" n="1735" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1735"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.711/26</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gonzales</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-03T16:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 3, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your April 1, 12 p.m., and April 2, 5 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d805-f1"/>
                    Department concurs that best solution is for Spanish ships to entirely
                    discontinue run from Habana to Mexico, discharging instead at Habana then
                    returning to Spain via United States.</p>
                <p>What disposition was made of mails on <hi rendition="#italic"> Alfonso XIII?</hi>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d805-f1" n="1" xml:id="d805-f1-content">
                <p>The latter not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
